  "title": "· New Bags | Bottega Veneta Unveils 2026 Qixi Capsule Collection: Andiamo Mini and Giorno Flap Bag ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Bottega Veneta 上架2026七夕甄选系列包袋：Andiamo 迷你包，Giorno 翻盖包",
  "excerpt": "Bottega Veneta's 2026 Qixi capsule offers mini Intrecciato bags in soft neutral tones, blending romance with everyday elegance.",
