      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Bottega Veneta has just unveiled its 2026 Qixi (Chinese Valentine's Day) capsule collection, continuing the house's signature Intrecciato woven leather technique. The Andiamo and Campana bags make a debut in refined mini sizes, dressed in low-saturation hues like Sea Salt White, Light Beige, and Cloud Gray. Whether for a date, daily errands, or commuting, they strike a sweet yet elegant note.",
