      "text": "· Andiamo ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Andiamo bag is still crafted from Intrecciato woven calfskin, with a gold metal knot as its most recognizable signature. This season, it arrives in a mini size measuring 15cm high, 20cm wide, and 9cm deep, featuring an interior compartment and a sliding crossbody strap. Its compact proportions are especially flattering for petite Asian women. Available in Sea Salt White and Light Beige.",
